msgid "Is this affiliated with the CRA?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-bomcas-listing.php:201
msgid "No. BOMCAS Canada builds the plugin. It is not the Canada Revenue Agency, and it is not a tax filing service."
msgstr ""

